        {"zh": "我用尾巴扫了一下", "en": "I sweep my tail once."},
        {"zh": "它自己退了出去", "en": "It backs out on its own."},
        {"zh": "我撞得自己也晃", "en": "I rock from my own blow."},
        {"zh": "我慢慢又往前走", "en": "I creep forward again."},
        {"zh": "我软软地撞你一下，像推。", "en": "I bump you softly, more a nudge than a blow."},
